msgstr "— 3-Minuten-Rennen in permanenter Dunkelheit mit Nebelschwaden"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_hockey_showdown.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
